          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અફવા — aphvā — \"a rumour\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગામમાં અફવા ફેલાઈ કે ડાકુ આવ્યા છે. gāmmā̃ aphvā phelāī ke ḍāku āvyā che. A rumour went round the village that bandits had come."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અફવા (aphvā) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic afwāh, \"mouths\": what passes from mouth to mouth. It ફેલાય છે, spreads."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
