            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કોઈએ જાણી જોઈને આ અફવા ફેલાવી. koīe jāṇī joīne ā aphvā phelāvī. Someone spread this rumour on purpose."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે અફવા ફેલાવી, teṇe aphvā phelāvī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ફેલાવવું (phelāvvũ) is the causative of ફેલાવું, to spread, which goes back to Sanskrit prathita, \"spread out\" (CDIAL 8651): to make something spread. જાણી જોઈને, knowing and seeing, is on purpose."
            }
          ]
